{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9Mb3ZlJTIwQ3V0cyUyMCUyODIwMTAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Love Cuts","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rQrL5ESCjzlUnKEBpuUiPSkeHjg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vFqA8tAMRIx2KghgwB3qXJ8lZ2A.jpg","description":"Forty-something Cecilia better known as Sissy to her friends is a cheery and vivacious seamstress. Wai Mun, her husband of many years is the captain of an acclaimed Chinese restaurant. Although somewhat discontented with life since his migration from Hong Kong to Singapore, he and Sissy are a loving couple and enjoy a blissful marriage. They have a 15-year-old son and a nine-year-old daughter who has a very close relationship with Sissy and is a source of great cheer and comfort to her. In a twist of fate, an unexpected occurrence befalls their seemingly mediocre and uneventful lives. One day as Sissy feels a hard lump in her left breast. A gush of complex emotions overwhelms her.","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"7.8","runtime":"118 min","cast":["Zoe Tay","Kenny Ho Ka-King","Allan Wu","Christy Yow","Regene Lim","Edwin Goh","Huang Shinan","Anna Ru Ping Lim"],"director":["Gerald Lee"],"released":"2010-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Zoe Tay","character":"Sissy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iif4d9DWMhCYCt0Sgb0zEaOW5kM.jpg"},{"name":"Kenny Ho Ka-King","character":"Wai Mun","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6gQZYCr0ts1NAfCDNboxkNCA0L6.jpg"},{"name":"Allan Wu","character":"Timothy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9V4mZFerglq2QFg09jQZEE88xvt.jpg"},{"name":"Christy Yow","character":"Kristie Kong","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gDSRdzuy5v5nWPHfUtKTISWh4Tl.jpg"},{"name":"Regene Lim","character":"Daughter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pYqN6GDaXR3skJFw4QOuIbBZ1m4.jpg"},{"name":"Edwin Goh","character":"Son","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/